    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_integrator" kindref="compound">Integrator</ref> - to solve the linear algebraic system arising from the upwind implicit form of the transport equations.</para>
<para>Operations<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>IntegrateOver( equation, domain, time )</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AssignInitialConditions( domain )</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AssignEssentialConditions( domain )</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>InsertInMatrix()</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>InsertInVector()</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Solve( solver );</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>PostProcess( domain );</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>OutputResults( domain ); Attributes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_sparse_matrix" kindref="compound">SparseMatrix</ref> A_;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Vector rhs_;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Vector x_; </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
